## 9. SENSOR MEASUREMENT MODEL

Create a measurement model containing at least:

```text
recordId
deviceCode
sequence
measuredAt
timeSynced
temperature
humidity
soilMoisture
lightIntensity
ph
waterLevel
batteryVoltage
```

After the gateway collects it, attach gateway metadata:

```text
gatewayCode
collectedAt
gatewayRssi
syncStatus
```

Example local record:

```json
{
  "recordId": "SENSOR-001-100",
  "deviceCode": "SENSOR-001",
  "sequence": 100,
  "measuredAt": 1720000000,
  "timeSynced": true,
  "collectedAt": 1720000100,
  "gatewayCode": "GATEWAY-001",
  "gatewayRssi": -52,
  "temperature": 30.2,
  "humidity": 75.1,
  "soilMoisture": 48.5,
  "lightIntensity": null,
  "ph": null,
  "waterLevel": null,
  "batteryVoltage": 4.02,
  "syncStatus": "PENDING"
}
```

