## 17. NODE REGISTRY

Create:

```text
NodeRegistry
```

Responsibilities:

- Add/update registered nodes.
- Resolve node by deviceCode.
- Update lastSeen.
- Mark authentication result.
- Track IP address.
- Track RSSI when available.
- Mark stale nodes offline.
- Return active-node list.

Avoid an unnecessarily large fixed array.

But also avoid complicated STL usage if it causes embedded-memory problems.

Use a reasonable maximum node count for the prototype, for example:

```cpp
MAX_SENSOR_NODES = 20
```

Make it configurable.

